  "prefLabel": "Nur 501.01 Obligation to Obey",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nur 501.01 Obligation to Obey.\n\n(a) The ethical requirements set forth in this part shall bind all licensees and certificate holders and, as applicable, applicants for a license.\n\n(b) Violations of any of the rules in this part shall be included within the scope of the term \"unprofessional conduct\" as used in RSA 326-B:37, II(h) and shall result in disciplinary action by the board.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Nur 100) #5887, eff 8-26-94; ss by #6778, eff 6-26-98; ss by #7769, eff 10-1-02; ss by #8873, eff 4-24-07; ss by #10300, eff 3-22-13; ss by #13673, eff 6-23-23; ss by #14297, eff 8-25-25, EXPIRES: 8-25-35",
